<p>Project a bolt of corrupted blood, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">115, 154, 185, 211, 234</acronym> blight damage and healing you for 20% the damage dealt.</p><p>50% of the damage dealt will be gained as maximum life for 7 turns (before the healing).</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>